The '''Den of the White Worms''',<ref name="Official Guide">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]''</ref> also known as the '''White Worms' den''',<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|white-worms-den|White Worms' den}}</ref> the '''White Worm lair''',<ref name="Most Wanted" /> or '''Lady Proxima's Lair''',<ref name="Bounty Hunters 21">[[Bounty Hunters 21|''Bounty Hunters'' 21]]</ref> was the headquarters of the [[White Worms]] criminal gang in [[Coronet City]] on the [[planet]] [[Corellia]].<ref name="Solo" />

